window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Nina</p> <p>I’ve been forced into an arranged marriage with the heir of the Italian mafia.</p> <p>My brother made it clear.</p> <p>Either I marry him, or he’ll make me wish I was dead.</p> <p>I knew what was expected of me.</p> <p>Put on a smile. Sit pretty. Say nothing.</p> <p>What I didn’t expect was him.</p> <p>My fiancée’s father. Twenty-five years older.</p> <p>Forbidden.</p> <p>And the only man who’s ever seen me.</p> <p>Enzo</p> <p>It should’ve been a simple arrangement.</p> <p>But she ruined it. Ruined me.</p> <p>Nina was the prettiest thing I’d ever seen.</p> <p>Strong, intelligent…a virgin.</p> <p>And my son’s fiancée.</p> <p>I never wanted anything more.</p> <p>To my credit, I tried to resist her.</p> <p>But when her safety is threatened, I snap.</p> <p>My son can’t have her.</p> <p>Because no one touches what’s mine.</p> <p>Sinful Temptation is a standalone age-gap forbidden romance and has content that may be triggering to some listeners. For a full list of TWs please check the author’s website.</p>"; 
